Microsoft Singularity RDK reference mirror — licensing notice

This repository contains a historical copy of Microsoft Research Singularity RDK
materials. The repository-level file must not be interpreted as relicensing the
upstream RDK source tree.

The licensing terms for the Singularity RDK are the terms distributed with the
original RDK materials. In this mirror, see in particular:

    SOURCE/Singularity RDK 2.0 License.pdf

and any component-specific notices present inside the source tree.

Repository-local documentation or metadata authored separately from the RDK may
have its own terms only when those terms are stated explicitly for that material.
No blanket MIT grant is made here for Microsoft Research source code or other
third-party material.

Original project provenance: Microsoft Research / Singularity project.
This repository is maintained as a historical research reference, not as a claim
of authorship or ownership of the upstream Singularity RDK.
